<title>POLAND: POLISH GDANSK PORT CARGO TRANSFER UP 14 PCT IN H1.</title>
<headline>POLISH GDANSK PORT CARGO TRANSFER UP 14 PCT IN H1.</headline>
<dateline>GDANSK, Poland 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo transfer in the</p>
<p>Polish port of Gdansk rose 14 percent in the first half of this</p>
<p>year against the same period of last year to 8.992 million</p>
<p>tonnes, the port's management said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(IN MLN T)	H1 1997   H1 1996  pct difference</p>
<p>TOTAL		 8.99	7.86	14.O</p>
<p>COAL		  3.55	2.81	26.0</p>
<p>IRON ORE	    0.21	0.10     105.0</p>
<p>MASS PRODUCTS     1.56	1.39	11.0</p>
<p>GRAIN		 0.20	0.11	76.0</p>
<p>WOOD		  0.009     0.002    313.0</p>
<p>FUEL		  2.68	2.41	11.0</p>
<p>SMALL BULK	  0.79	1.03     -23.0</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
